                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d618-f3" n="20" xml:id="d618-f3-content">
                <p>Recommended points transmitted on February 11 to the Secretaries of War and Navy
                    for discussion on February 12.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
